// CONTRACT: panic() is NOT catchable (CLAUDE.md, docs/language-guide/error-handling.md)
// Unlike throw, panic exits immediately even inside try/catch. If this test
// ever exits 0, the panic/throw distinction has been broken.

try {
    panic("unrecoverable");
} catch (e) {
    print("caught - CONTRACT VIOLATION");
}
print("unreachable");
